msgstr "%s（%s，信道 %s）"

msgid "%s GHz (channel %s)"
msgstr "%s GHz（信道 %s）"

msgid "2.4 GHz"
msgstr "2.4 GHz"

msgid "4 hex digits (0-9 / a-f); clear it and press Enter to fall back to the SSID-derived value. All interfaces of the same SSID are updated together."
msgstr "4 位十六进制（0-9 / a-f）；清空并回车即恢复按 SSID 自动派生。同一 SSID 的所有接口会一起更新。"

msgid "5 GHz"
msgstr "5 GHz"

msgid "6 GHz"
msgstr "6 GHz"

msgid "802.11k neighbor report"
msgstr "802.11k 邻居报告"

msgid "802.11k/v/r only publish information: an AP can answer \"who else is there\", and a client can ask on its own. DAWN does the other half — it aggregates what every device sees for each client, scores the candidate APs, and then has the current AP hand the client to a better one with a BSS Transition. With two devices on the same SSID and nothing making that decision, a client sticks to its original AP until the signal dies completely."
msgstr "802.11k/v/r 只是把信息发出去：AP 能回答“还有谁”，客户端也可以自己问。DAWN 负责的是另一半 —— 它汇总所有设备看到的每个客户端，给候选 AP 打分，再让当前 AP 用 BSS Transition 把客户端交到更好的那一个上。两台设备同一个 SSID 而没有任何东西做这个决定，客户端就会一直粘在原 AP 上直到信号彻底断掉。"

msgid "802.11k/v/r roaming"
msgstr "802.11k/v/r 漫游"

msgid "802.11r cannot be enabled on an open / OWE network"
msgstr "开放 / OWE 网络无法开启 802.11r"

msgid "802.11r fast roaming"
msgstr "802.11r 快速漫游"

msgid "802.11s needs a hostapd built with mesh support (wpad-mesh-* or wpad-openssl). No mesh features were found in /usr/sbin/hostapd, so the interface may not come up."
msgstr "802.11s 需要带 mesh 支持的 hostapd（wpad-mesh-* 或 wpad-openssl）。当前检测到 /usr/sbin/hostapd 里没有 mesh 相关特性，接口可能起不来。"

msgid "802.11v BTM transition"
msgstr "802.11v BTM 过渡"

msgid "AP"
msgstr "AP"

msgid "APs and clients"
msgstr "AP 与客户端"

msgid "Absolute RSSI"
msgstr "绝对 RSSI"

msgid "Add points when the signal is better than this"
msgstr "信号好于此值时加分"

msgid "All devices must use the same key"
msgstr "所有设备必须使用同一个密钥"

