msgstr "该频段 AP 的基础分：2.4G 一般比 5G/6G 低一些"

msgid "Both"
msgstr "两者都要"

msgid "Bridge to LAN (both devices on one layer-2)"
msgstr "桥接到 LAN（两台设备同一二层）"

msgid "Broadcast address"
msgstr "广播地址"

msgid "Broadcast port"
msgstr "广播端口"

msgid "Channel utilization (scaled from 0-255)"
msgstr "信道利用率（0-255 换算）"

msgid "Channel utilization averaging period"
msgstr "信道利用率平均周期"

msgid "Cleared; back to deriving from the SSID (%s)."
msgstr "已清空，恢复按 SSID 自动派生（%s）。"

msgid "Click \"Scan LAN for devices\" to find XR1710G units on the same LAN."
msgstr "点击“扫描局域网设备”查找同一局域网内的 XR1710G。"

msgid "Click to disable %s"
msgstr "点击关闭 %s"

msgid "Click to enable %s"
msgstr "点击开启 %s"

msgid "Client"
msgstr "客户端"

msgid "Clients"
msgstr "客户端数"

msgid "Config revision"
msgstr "配置版本"

msgid "Configured"
msgstr "已配置"

msgid "Connected"
msgstr "已连接"

msgid "Consecutive evaluation count"
msgstr "连续判定次数"

msgid "Create an 802.11s mesh interface on the selected radio and bridge it to the LAN, so both devices share one layer-2 network. Native 802.11s, no batman-adv required."
msgstr "在选定的 radio 上建立 802.11s mesh 接口并桥接到 LAN，两台设备即处于同一二层网络。原生 802.11s，不需要 batman-adv。"

msgid "DAWN hands a client off with the 802.11v BSS Transition, and 802.11k tells it whom to hand the client to. Turn on K and V for these SSIDs in the table above."
msgstr "DAWN 靠 802.11v 的 BSS Transition 把客户端交出去，802.11k 让它知道该交给谁。请在上面的表格里把这些 SSID 的 K 与 V 打开。"

msgid "DAWN has not learned any AP yet."
msgstr "DAWN 还没有学到任何 AP。"

msgid "DAWN is not installed"
msgstr "没有安装 DAWN"

msgid "DAWN key"
msgstr "DAWN 密钥"

msgid "DAWN not installed"
msgstr "DAWN 未安装"

msgid "DAWN service unavailable"
msgstr "DAWN 服务不可用"

msgid "DAWN without the 6 GHz patch only has two parameter sets, 802_11g and 802_11a, so 6G is treated as the last group (802_11a) and shares its scores. The 6 GHz row below can still be filled in and synced, but only firmware carrying the patches/feeds/packages/net/dawn patch actually reads it."
msgstr "没有打 6 GHz 补丁的 DAWN 只有 802_11g 与 802_11a 两组参数，6G 会被判成最后一组（802_11a）共用同样的分数。下面的 6 GHz 行可以照常填写并参与同步，但只有带 patches/feeds/packages/net/dawn 补丁的固件才会真正读它。"

msgid "Derived from the \"wired sync\" shared key (recommended)"
msgstr "派生自“有线同步”共享密钥（推荐）"

msgid "Device"
msgstr "设备"

msgid "Disable 802.11s"
msgstr "停用 802.11s"

msgid "Disable k/v/r"
msgstr "关闭 k/v/r"

