msgid "Overwrite %s with the wireless config of this device (the peer decides whether to stagger channels). Continue?"
msgstr "将用本机的无线配置覆盖 %s（对端按自身设置决定是否错开信道），继续？"

msgid "Overwrite this device with the wireless config from %s%s (the current config is backed up to /etc/config/wireless.meshconf-bak). Continue?"
msgstr "将用 %s 的无线配置覆盖本机%s（当前配置会备份到 /etc/config/wireless.meshconf-bak），继续？"

msgid "Please enter a Mesh ID; both devices must use the same one."
