msgstr "请先在“有线同步”里设置共享密钥：DAWN 的密钥由它派生，否则两台设备无法互相解密。"

msgid "Please set the shared key; all devices must match it, otherwise sync will fail."
msgstr "请设置共享密钥：所有设备必须一致，否则无法同步。"

msgid "Points added or subtracted per 1 dB away from the center; once it is non-zero the two fields below are de-emphasised and the score mostly tracks signal strength"
msgstr "每偏离中点 1 dB 的加减分；设为非 0 后下面两项会被弱化，评分主要跟着信号强 弱走"

